a_helot_of_Mujaki (204078)
a_servant_of_Mujaki (204077)

wave 1 = 3
wave 2 = 3
wave 3 = 3
wave 4 = 6
wave 5 = 6
wave 6 = 6
wave 7 = 6
wave 8 = 3
wave 9 = mujaki + any adds that got by. adds turn from invulnv to KoS

(supposedly 36 mobs must die and / or reach stage to spawn Mujaki)
